{"id":3813,"date":"2025-05-24T03:03:10","date_gmt":"2025-05-24T03:03:10","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=3813"},"modified":"2025-08-11T04:57:32","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T04:57:32","slug":"tiktok-agency","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-tiktok\/tiktok-agency\/","title":{"rendered":"TikTok Agency: \u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n c\u00f9ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"IllhdmGJRo8Fc8xW7til2HR2gRd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VHggdHLy4oFEVMxnGyNloSymgvh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok Agency kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p trong su\u1ed1t h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok. Nh\u1eefng ti\u00eau ch\u00ed l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn n\u00e0o l\u00e0 uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng TikTok Agency l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng ai. H\u00e3y c\u00f9ng kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 ngay trong b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft d\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y!<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h2>TikTok Agency l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h2>\n<div data-page-id=\"IllhdmGJRo8Fc8xW7til2HR2gRd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P8sldd2IwoSBhixUTZyl9sTygvc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok Agency l\u00e0 c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng ty ho\u1eb7c t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ea5p ph\u00e9p v\u00e0 h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c b\u1edfi TikTok, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u00e0nh l\u1ea1pa nh\u1eb1m h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 doanh nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng t\u1ed1i \u0111a ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y. V\u1edbi s\u1ef1 \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp t\u1eeb TikTok, c\u00e1c agency n\u00e0y cung c\u1ea5p c\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p nh\u01b0 t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c, v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t n\u1ed9i dung s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd gian h\u00e0ng TikTok Shop, gi\u00fap doanh nghi\u1ec7p ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng tr\u00ean TikTok.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OAlmdP3vsoOzv2xArR1lrV4mgie\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ngo\u00e0i ra, d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 c\u00f2n bao g\u1ed3m k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i v\u1edbi TikTok Shop ho\u1eb7c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh Affiliate (ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb li\u00ean k\u1ebft) \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 doanh nghi\u1ec7p m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng k\u00eanh b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng. \u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t, agency c\u0169ng h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00edch xanh v\u00e0 x\u00e1c minh t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n cho doanh nghi\u1ec7p, gi\u00fap x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng \u0111\u1ed9 tin c\u1eady tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3839\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3839\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3839\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-lemon.vn_-1-300x157.png\" alt=\"\u1ea2nh \u0111\u1ea7u trang cho th\u1ea5y TikTok ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 1 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-lemon.vn_-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-lemon.vn_-1-scaled-600x314.png 600w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-lemon.vn_-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-lemon.vn_-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-lemon.vn_-1-1536x804.png 1536w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-lemon.vn_-1-2048x1072.png 2048w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-lemon.vn_-1-scaled.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3839\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n c\u00f9ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/span><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"IllhdmGJRo8Fc8xW7til2HR2gRd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-EtNbdIymGoHsm9xtdX7ltJEdgLg\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>TikTok Agency<\/strong><strong> v\u00e0 <\/strong><strong>TikTok<\/strong><strong>Ads Agency kh\u00e1c g\u00ec nhau?<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<table class=\"ace-table\" style=\"width: 97.8723%;\" data-ace-table-col-widths=\"214;346;406\">\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"214\" \/>\n<col width=\"346\" \/>\n<col width=\"406\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 19.082%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W0eOdkOFXofOVMxDamrlhjOighx\"><strong>Ti\u00eau Ch\u00ed <\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 40.132%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MdRMdOxXrolfIJxce4elrthQgWh\"><strong>TikTok Agency<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 82.9532%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K6B6dOSlioJgDFxc40Bl1YROgHf\"><strong>TikTok Ads Agency<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 19.082%; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9pTdQv2OoHj65xq9w1l0