E6llH8hUgle\"><strong>Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 40.132%; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QlyidASNRoESzJxNrGkl62CFgId\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, doanh nghi\u1ec7p, creator, influencer, TikTok Shop Partner,&#8230;<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 82.9532%; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KWjidfimmovMoaxOXQzloPcFgpd\">Doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u1ea7n ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n, traffic ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 19.082%; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UpU0d8GQ5ozRxJxx8TIlVKLxgnb\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 40.132%; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Rl2IdH46GoRMzZxWBbzl72wwgmg\">K\u1ebft n\u1ed1i c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, X\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n\/doanh nghi\u1ec7p to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n, Ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o nh\u1eafm m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau, T\u1ea1o v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 82.9532%; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T458dJPjqoKHgLx37Y2lmfTUgEe\">Gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed nhanh, T\u1ea1o v\u00e0 ti\u00eau th\u1ee5 n\u1ed9i dung theo trend, X\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u1edbi gi\u1edbi tr\u1ebb, Influencer marketing.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 19.082%; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Te09dQzIgoGzo1xq6CXlLbsrgOc\"><strong>D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 cung c\u1ea5p<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OsZLdxn73oR2JDxBeuSlST1Cg0g\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 40.132%; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YxmtdD9PGospAuxTcMclWeFagIg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>X\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng n\u1ed9i dung<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZXJidYaFwoCEn2x05WLlIjJygpc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n k\u00eanh TikTok<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z75NdtmaUoVAfkxIYE5lriAhgye\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd TikTok Shop<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UDJPddeZSoNmR2xZ8Z3lQQy3g2b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn Affiliate<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NuaUda1xsoLoiPxu6hTlH9fsgpf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u00edch xanh<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BB7zdnUX0ocFtCx5clllK9zYgIc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>V\u1eadn h\u00e0nh s\u00e0n TikTok Shop<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 82.9532%; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BWbGdPbgXo8ra1xL9lnlgOnxgsh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u01b0 v\u1ea5n chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BqYzdhxlvoHoBjxk2cWlkcnFgKf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LwjSdoVG4obV3mxGX25lJcklgHc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GPP7dxPvzokahhxizE1lKLaVgUe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>B\u00e1o c\u00e1o hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OIZrdHOAtobcTPxWBq6l2CXTgif\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-OGUJdRGnboDI6jxn8r1lsErQgIc\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a <\/strong><strong>TikTok Agency<\/strong><strong> cung c\u1ea5p <\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HPZudMIT0ofzAxx132BlxoTmgzc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok Agency cung c\u1ea5p d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c gi\u00fap doanh nghi\u1ec7p x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u tr\u00ean TikTok. Ch\u00fang t\u00f4i ph\u00e2n t\u00edch th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng, \u0111\u1ed1i th\u1ee7 v\u00e0 h\u00e0nh vi ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t n\u1ed9i dung ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p, k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecbnh h\u01b0\u1edbng truy\u1ec1n th\u00f4ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-BuVqdIYvjoDspmx2jSolCF8Mg5b\" style=\"text-align: left;\">T\u01b0 v\u1ea5n chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Di4rdnWMVotzlexq78zl579Cgl3\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok Agency cung c\u1ea5p d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c, h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 doanh nghi\u1ec7p \u0111\u1ecbnh h\u00ecnh th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok. T\u00f9y theo t\u1eebng chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chia l\u00e0m 3 giai \u0111o\u1ea1n t\u1eeb ng\u1eafn h\u1ea1n (1 &#8211; 3 th\u00e1ng), trung h\u1ea1n (3 &#8211; 6 th\u00e1ng), cho t\u1edbi d\u00e0i h\u1ea1n (6 &#8211; 12 th\u00e1ng).<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-MuModb82Vo375IxFlVFlnLWNgZF\" style=\"text-align: left;\">V\u1eadn h\u00e0nh v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd Tikok Ads<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V9v9dTcuJoc9e2xY1I5le1uRgvg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Vi\u1ec7c tri\u1ec3n khai qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o tr\u00ean TikTok \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi ki\u1ebfn th\u1ee9c chuy\u00ean s\u00e2u v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng t\u1ed1i \u01b0u li\u00ean t\u1ee5c \u0111\u1ec3 mang l\u1ea1i hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 cao. <strong>TikTok Agency<\/strong> <strong>s\u1ebd<\/strong> <strong>h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 doanh nghi\u1ec7p t\u1eeb A-Z <\/strong>trong vi\u1ec7c l\u00ean k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch, thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp v\u00e0 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HlxkdVjiKo8BMfxE0DllCH1xgXZ\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Muc ti\u00eau ch\u00ednh khi v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd Tikok Ads gi\u00fap t\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn nhanh ch\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1ec7p kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u00e0 doanh nghi\u1ec7p mu\u1ed1n nh\u1ea5m \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1edbi k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ea7u ra l\u00e0 l\u01b0\u1ee3t view, l\u01b0\u1ee3t click, chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i (leads, mua h\u00e0ng, c\u00e0i app&#8230;)<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-H6nkdnJdqoKAtwxA2Ttl00IQg2e\" style=\"text-align: left;\">V\u1eadn h\u00e0nh v\u00e0 thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp gian h\u00e0ng TikTok Shop<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PHdxdyuoBoDkhpxE9TwlzSfYgfb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ch\u00fang t\u00f4i cung c\u1ea5p gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p tr\u1ecdn g\u00f3i gi\u00fap doanh nghi\u1ec7p b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 tr\u00ean TikTok Shop.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MRTIdOkyvoYzyGxRieMlN6CwgMg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bao g\u1ed3m:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YxbIdJn3Cor74LxU1cLl7Zwvg5b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u gian h\u00e0ng chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A9HRdThNMoCn5vxTYSRlR6c0gTe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\u0110\u0103ng t\u1ea3i s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd h\u00e0ng t\u1ed3n kho v\u00e0 \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CfdvdQtgNoe27Tx210hlzmjngKg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<p>H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng n\u1ed9i dung, t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng KOLs\/creators \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y doanh s\u1ed1.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-W7c6d09GloXV5gxU7C7lxdfZgQg\" style=\"text-align: left;\">S\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Rcxgdjmd0oKV5nxK70OlusgQgle\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>S\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o<\/strong> l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n quan tr\u1ecdng gi\u00fap doanh nghi\u1ec7p thu h\u00fat ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem, truy\u1ec1n t\u1ea3i th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng viral tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok. Lemon Digital cung c\u1ea5p c\u00e1c g\u00f3i d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 video nh\u01b0:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mhthd1KZ7oPGuSx5tY1lXCPzgXf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Video Shopping Base: th\u1eddi l\u01b0\u1ee3ng video d\u00e0i t\u1eeb 15 &#8211; 30 gi\u00e2y, t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o vi\u1ec7c gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u nhanh c\u00e1c t\u00ednh n\u0103ng v\u00e0 l\u1ee3i \u00edch ch\u00ednh c\u1ee7a s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m. V\u1edbi video ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u1edbi chi ph\u00ed h\u1ee3p l\u00fd v\u00e0 th\u1eddi gian s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t nhanh ch\u00f3ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FfkbdKpO0oGt06xgXuklVZLJgGg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Video Shopping Pro: th\u1eddi l\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u1eeb 30 gi\u00e2y \u0111\u1ebfn 1 ph\u00fat ho\u1eb7c h\u01a1n (t\u00f9y thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau v\u00e0 n\u1ed9i dung c\u1ea7n truy\u1ec1n t\u1ea3i) \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o ra nh\u1eefng video ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng cao nh\u1eb1m th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng mua h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 t\u0103ng c\u01b0\u1eddng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-FYrPdNE39oOzCwx0dwZlJbnkg5g\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Thu\u00ea studio v\u00e0 host livestream<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NxG3dADyLos7cKxtPoPlXIb9ghd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam, Lemon Digital l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng agency chuy\u00ean s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 cho th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111a n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt tr\u00ean TikTok. B\u00ean c\u1ea1nh \u0111\u00f3 Lemon c\u00f2n cung c\u1ea5p d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 cho thu\u00ea studio v\u00e0 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 livestream v\u1edbi h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng trang thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 MC chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, gi\u00e0u kinh nghi\u1ec7m. Ch\u00fang t\u00f4i lu\u00f4n s\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ec3 n\u00e2ng cao ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng n\u1ed9i dung livestream, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-QWLidV43doBK3Kx8jSYlKMu7gie\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong> Ti\u00eau ch\u00ed l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn <\/strong><strong>TikTok Agency<\/strong><strong> uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZCydO6wzoS0WuxowgllQElkgOb\">Vi\u1ec7c l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn m\u1ed9t TikTok Agency uy t\u00edn \u0111\u00f3ng vai tr\u00f2 then ch\u1ed1t trong chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-QjERdRrEloPt6bxs6w2l5bXcgcc\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c c\u1ee7a TikTok<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sa28dAO59oP39ZxPLyeldwhDgge\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c c\u1ee7a TikTok l\u00e0 c\u00e1c t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c ho\u1eb7c doanh nghi\u1ec7p \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c TikTok c\u1ea5p ch\u1ee9ng nh\u1eadn, nh\u1eb1m h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, doanh nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n do TikTok \u0111\u1ec1 ra.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<table class=\"ace-table\" style=\"width: 99.478%; height: 363px;\" data-ace-table-col-widths=\"249;574\">\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"249\" \/>\n<col width=\"574\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 30.3249%; height: 24px;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PJ9fd494NozVAvxzZE9lNT5Vgeh\"><strong>\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 86.1773%; height: 24px;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QWOzdFUTkoIzTfxTEWolMcJBgpb\"><strong>Vai tr\u00f2<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 99px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.3249%; height: 99px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O3jadAzjQoR2Y3xo5lelQ3mFgzh\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>TikTok Marketing Partner (TMP): <\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 86.1773%; height: 99px;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TSX3dsjXJokGE0x0FQBlpiZGgqc\">Nh\u1eefng \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb n\u00e0y gi\u1ed1ng nh\u01b0 \u201ctr\u1ee3 l\u00fd\u201d \u0111\u1eafc l\u1ef1c c\u1ee7a doanh nghi\u1ec7p tr\u00ean TikTok. H\u1ecd s\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n l\u00ean k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 h\u01a1n, h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung thu h\u00fat ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi ph\u00e2n t\u00edch d\u1eef li\u1ec7u v\u00e0 theo d\u00f5i k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ec3 bi\u1ebft r\u00f5 chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111ang ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng ra sao.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 96px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.3249%; height: 96px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SfDqd7A92oK9wRxW0QnlO643gr5\"><strong>TikTok Agency Partner: <\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 86.1773%; height: 96px;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CS4FdWIg9o3XF1xuxXalVQYGgIc\">L\u00e0 c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng ty ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng trong l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c truy\u1ec1n th\u00f4ng, c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n cho doanh nghi\u1ec7p t\u1eeb vi\u1ec7c l\u00ean chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c marketing, s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t n\u1ed9i dung s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi xu h\u01b0\u1edbng, cho \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 72px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.3249%; height: 72px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OOYxd2nbKoSp65xgbBrlnVnyg2e\"><strong>TikTokShop Partner: <\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 86.1773%; height: 72px;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UkPFdxcOwoOGqfx6Ih8lXWM6glF\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c TikTok \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh TikTok Shop. H\u1ecd \u0111\u1ea3m nhi\u1ec7m vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u00e0o t\u1ea1o ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n, x\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a kinh doanh.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 72px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.3249%; height: 72px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CcWvdacu8o5RFZxF6MSlguhUgFc\"><strong>TikTok Creator Marketplace Partner: <\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 86.1773%; height: 72px;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SNAhdjtN3oQzFTxkH5Llo343gLh\">L\u00e0 nh\u1eefng n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng ho\u1eb7c t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c chuy\u00ean k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u1edbi c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung tr\u00ean TikTok nh\u1eb1m tri\u1ec3n khai c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch marketing d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean s\u1ee9c \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng c\u1ee7a creator.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<h3>\u00a0<\/h3>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-QSRFdUzY3oTIFYxLYKDlwMGGgnh\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 kinh nghi\u1ec7m<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0DZdvO0CoKcMtxRXAol5NX7gyc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 kinh nghi\u1ec7m c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t TikTok Agency kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 qua th\u00e0nh t\u00edch \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u00e0 c\u00f2n d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 nh\u00e2n s\u1ef1, kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o, c\u00f9ng s\u1ef1 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p trong vi\u1ec7c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch marketing tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y. C\u00f3 nhi\u1ec1u y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 quan tr\u1ecdng g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n v\u00e0o s\u1ef1 th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng, bao g\u1ed3m:<\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JoUndo1COoasynx5tgXlOLEmgDc\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Th\u00e0nh t\u00edch v\u00e0 c\u00e1c d\u1ef1 \u00e1n ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh:<\/strong> M\u1ed9t TikTok Agency uy t\u00edn th\u01b0\u1eddng c\u00f3 nhi\u1ec1u d\u1ef1 \u00e1n th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng v\u1edbi \u0111a d\u1ea1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, t\u1eeb l\u1edbn \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1ecf. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y ch\u1ee9ng t\u1ecf h\u1ecd hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng, bi\u1ebft c\u00e1ch x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng n\u1ed9i dung s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o, b\u1eaft trend nhanh, v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 bi\u1ebfn n\u1ed9i dung th\u00e0nh k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf \u2013 nh\u01b0 t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem, t\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c, ho\u1eb7c th\u1eadm ch\u00ed t\u0103ng doanh s\u1ed1 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng cho kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LGKidbqsRoQDcOxbiJdlUGgzggd\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i t\u1eeb kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng:<\/strong> S\u1ef1 h\u00e0i l\u00f2ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 t\u00edch c\u1ef1c t\u1eeb kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 quan tr\u1ecdng ph\u1ea3n \u00e1nh s\u1ef1 uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 n\u0103ng l\u1ef1c c\u1ee7a agency.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J2ImdmKfuoH46XxmI7uljGNVgAf\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>X\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c marketing:<\/strong> Agency chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p c\u1ea7n c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3, t\u1eeb giai \u0111o\u1ea1n x\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a n\u1ed9i dung cho t\u1eebng chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QDIpdsQeko9E4HxBY7NlYaKggcb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 n\u00e0y k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p l\u1ea1i t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t TikTok Agency chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c k\u1ef3 v\u1ecdng c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng s\u00f4i \u0111\u1ed9ng n\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_3845\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3845\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3845\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-1.png\" alt=\"Uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 kinh nghi\u1ec7m\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-1-600x314.png 600w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-1-768x402.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3845\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">TikTok\u00a0 l\u1edbn m\u1ea1nh v\u01b0\u01a1n t\u1ea7m th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-XSR1dJdUJoWgXpxspvTldtA4gdp\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u0110\u1ed9 am hi\u1ec3u ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YRFRdYjIaorA3bx79xplfVJmgwG\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hi\u1ec3u bi\u1ebft s\u00e2u s\u1eafc v\u1ec1 ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t TikTok Agency \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n qua kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng n\u1eafm b\u1eaft s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau v\u00e0 c\u00e1c xu h\u01b0\u1edbng th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng. V\u1edbi s\u1ef1 am hi\u1ec3u n\u00e0y, agency c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o ra n\u1ed9i dung ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p, l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn KOL\/KOC ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c v\u00e0 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o t\u1ed1i \u01b0u.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HVqCdNEKZoDsl6x7te5lls2Tgag\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">M\u1ed9t agency n\u1eafm v\u1eefng ng\u00e0nh s\u1ebd gi\u00fap th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng, \u0111\u00fang c\u00e1ch, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y doanh s\u1ed1 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-R0MNdavkfo2gbUxBg1mlMILCg4d\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Ki\u1ebfn th\u1ee9c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCK3dMuoEo7MpcxFI7elitgaged\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Vi\u1ec7c n\u00e0y \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ph\u00e2n t\u00edch th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng s\u00e2u s\u1eafc, am hi\u1ec3u th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u00f9ng vi\u1ec7c x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch truy\u1ec1n th\u00f4ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3, b\u1eaft k\u1ecbp ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c nh\u00f3m \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng mua s\u1eafm v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u00e0nh c\u00e1c y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 t\u1eeb n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y h\u00e0nh vi v\u00e0 th\u00f3i quen. Ph\u00e2n t\u00edch c\u00e1ch c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u kh\u00e1c tri\u1ec3n khai chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c, r\u00fat kinh nghi\u1ec7m v\u00e0 t\u00ecm c\u00e1ch t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t, n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt cho chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh. Chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u0169ng ph\u1ea3i g\u1eafn li\u1ec1n v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 nh\u01b0 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ho\u1eb7c m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c ho\u1eb7c th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y doanh s\u1ed1 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T8PudoiHAoLOEyxBMVKlvAxCgkg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">G\u1ee3i \u00fd c\u00e1ch k\u1ec3 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u1ec1 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u theo c\u00e1ch t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, kh\u00e9o l\u00e9o l\u1ed3ng gh\u00e9p s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0o video m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng khi\u1ebfn ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem c\u1ea3m th\u1ea5y ph\u1ea3n c\u1ea3m.T\u01b0 v\u1ea5n l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn c\u00e1c h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o nh\u01b0 TikTok Ads ho\u1eb7c h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi TikTok Shop Partner ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch \u0111\u1eb7t ra, nh\u1eb1m t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-FcMYd754UoInpJx0onjlTFiagof\" style=\"text-align: left;\">K\u1ebft n\u1ed1i v\u1edbi influencers (n\u1ebfu mu\u1ed1n)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ev1sdCnF0oxm9yxk5Uolkn09gQe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">H\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi influencers qua TikTok Agency l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ec3 n\u00e2ng cao nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u. V\u1edbi m\u1ea1ng l\u01b0\u1edbi KOL\/KOC r\u1ed9ng l\u1edbn v\u00e0 li\u00ean k\u1ebft ch\u1eb7t ch\u1ebd, agency \u0111\u00f3ng vai tr\u00f2 c\u1ea7u n\u1ed1i gi\u00fap doanh nghi\u1ec7p t\u00ecm \u0111\u00fang ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau. Nh\u1edd \u0111\u00f3, chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c tri\u1ec3n khai chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p h\u01a1n v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 truy\u1ec1n th\u00f4ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FuvadK7jIoo5eAxm6E5l5w05gXb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_3844\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3844\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3844\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-7.png\" alt=\"H\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi influencers qua TikTok Agency\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-7.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-7-600x314.png 600w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-7-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-7-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-7-768x402.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3844\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">TikTok &#8211; V\u0169 tr\u1ee5 influencers<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YV74dKM4koMxXqxTyIslwAG6g9g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Guh2dpSlUoNamnxW0nileLd0gNf\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong> \u0110\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <\/strong><strong>TikTok Agency<\/strong><\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-FFdQdY6AooM5u7xPW7IlMVqrgsg\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Doanh nghi\u1ec7p mu\u1ed1n ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00e1n gi\u1ea3 tr\u1ebb tu\u1ed5i.<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DJjCdywcTolUkhxfUMwlaLrSgdd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Gen Z &#8211; hi\u1ec7n nay \u0111ang c\u00f3 \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng r\u1ea5t l\u1edbn \u0111\u1ebfn xu h\u01b0\u1edbng ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng v\u00e0 th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng. H\u1ecd kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi t\u1ea1o n\u00ean c\u00e1c tr\u00e0o l\u01b0u m\u1edbi, th\u00edch s\u1ef1 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o, hay t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u00e0 r\u1ea5t coi tr\u1ecdng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n. V\u00ec v\u1eady, n\u1ebfu c\u00e1c doanh nghi\u1ec7p mu\u1ed1n ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn v\u00e0 chinh ph\u1ee5c Gen Z, c\u1ea7n ph\u1ea3i ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u00fang n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng m\u00e0 h\u1ecd th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y. TikTok ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn r\u1ea5t h\u1ee3p l\u00fd. H\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi TikTok Agency s\u1ebd gi\u00fap c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 h\u01a1n v\u1ec1 Gen Z, t\u1ea1o ra n\u1ed9i dung ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u00e0 k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i th\u1eadt s\u1ef1 v\u1edbi c\u00e1c b\u1ea1n tr\u1ebb, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 t\u0103ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 truy\u1ec1n th\u00f4ng v\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RNYrdxEWdoo4jSxeUMdlisLtggh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea t\u1eeb Statista, h\u01a1n 70% ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng TikTok hi\u1ec7n nay n\u1eb1m trong \u0111\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i t\u1eeb 18 \u0111\u1ebfn 34, chi\u1ebfm \u0111a s\u1ed1 trong t\u1ed5ng s\u1ed1 ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-E71Dd5ZfGoELzQxi4yklIhyfgFe\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Doanh nghi\u1ec7p mu\u1ed1n t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YdsqdzSGIo3S6Uxt9gBlUoL6gHh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea t\u1eeb Backlinko, m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y c\u00f3 h\u01a1n 1 t\u1ef7 l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem video tr\u00ean TikTok, v\u1edbi th\u1eddi gian trung b\u00ecnh ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng d\u00e0nh ra kho\u1ea3ng 95 ph\u00fat\/ng\u00e0y. Ngo\u00e0i ra, theo b\u00e1o c\u00e1o c\u1ee7a Sprout Social, ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng TikTok t\u1ea1i Hoa K\u1ef3 \u0111\u00e3 d\u00e0nh t\u1ed5ng c\u1ed9ng 4,8 t\u1ef7 ph\u00fat m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y \u0111\u1ec3 xem video tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y, v\u01b0\u1ee3t qua c\u1ea3 Instagram v\u1edbi 4,127 t\u1ef7 ph\u00fat m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y cho th\u1ea5y TikTok l\u00e0 m\u1ea3nh \u0111\u1ea5t m\u00e0u m\u1ee1 \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 li\u00ean t\u1ee5c.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AqTKdxu4SoszrHxS0QYlhrY3gZf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">V\u00ec v\u1eady, vi\u1ec7c doanh nghi\u1ec7p t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng TikTok \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u l\u00e0 v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft. Th\u00f4ng qua c\u00e1c n\u1ed9i dung s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o, g\u1ea7n g\u0169i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem, th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng ghi d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n, t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n v\u00e0 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng l\u00f2ng tin v\u1edbi kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng \u2013 \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 th\u1ebf h\u1ec7 Gen Z v\u00e0 Millennials.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3846\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3846\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3846\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-1-1.png\" alt=\"T\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u \" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-1-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-1-1-600x314.png 600w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-1-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-1-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-1-1-768x402.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3846\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">T\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-LwZadrHSCozEAhxDdMvlWoAfgoh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;e17165c8-d352-4746-9e7e-59d029fae405&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:400,&quot;width&quot;:700,&quot;currHeight&quot;:400,&quot;currWidth&quot;:700,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:400,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:700,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FN0OObayDnoHIkxxjy8XlLZc3gLb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;N0OObayDnoHIkxxjy8XlLZc3gLb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:467361,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Pq2udjWilowiFyxV2Z8lzX9iglf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi n\u1ed5i ti\u1ebfng, influencer, creator mu\u1ed1n m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng t\u1ea7m \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UFCYd8yVjoo0ThxlnlflssOQgjh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi n\u1ed5i ti\u1ebfng, influencer hay creator mu\u1ed1n m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng t\u1ea7m \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng tr\u00ean TikTok l\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u d\u1ec5 hi\u1ec3u, nh\u01b0ng \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd v\u00e0 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n l\u00e0 \u0111\u0103ng t\u1ea3i n\u1ed9i dung. \u0110\u00e2y ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 l\u00fac TikTok Agency ph\u00e1t huy vai tr\u00f2 quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi Doanh nghi\u1ec7p mu\u1ed1n b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I1sQdAjexoXTbrxUvWElF01Gg5g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Doanh nghi\u1ec7p mu\u1ed1n b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop c\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u00e0i b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ec3 th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng. Do \u0111\u00f3, nhi\u1ec1u doanh nghi\u1ec7p l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi TikTok Agency \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CptAdlTpzoZYzExNq2pl0cCLgBf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Vi\u1ec7c h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t TikTok Agency gi\u00fap doanh nghi\u1ec7p ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m th\u1eddi gian, c\u00f4ng s\u1ee9c v\u00e0 ngu\u1ed3n l\u1ef1c, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng khi b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop. Agency cung c\u1ea5p chuy\u00ean m\u00f4n v\u00e0 kinh nghi\u1ec7m c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ed1i \u0111a h\u00f3a doanh thu v\u00e0 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mu0Zda3XzobuYnxTx8ClE4wJgCc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"IllhdmGJRo8Fc8xW7til2HR2gRd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-JxlFdkIG5o4CDpxWbl1lQIq5gMc\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong> Lemon Digital &#8211; <\/strong><strong>TikTok Agency<\/strong><strong> uy t\u00edn, nhi\u1ec1u n\u0103m kinh nghi\u1ec7m<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PmVqdARuJorhzkxRjPdlwqN9gQd\"><strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong> l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng <strong>TikTok Agency h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong>, v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u n\u0103m kinh nghi\u1ec7m trong l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb s\u1ed1 v\u00e0 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok. S\u1edf h\u1eefu \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 chuy\u00ean gia s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o am hi\u1ec3u s\u00e2u s\u1eafc v\u1ec1 h\u00e0nh vi c\u1ee7a Gen Z c\u00f9ng c\u00e1c xu h\u01b0\u1edbng n\u1ed9i dung m\u1edbi nh\u1ea5t, Lemon Digital \u0111\u00e3 h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi h\u00e0ng tr\u0103m th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u l\u1edbn nh\u1ecf, h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 gia t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem, c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n doanh s\u1ed1 v\u00e0 n\u00e2ng cao nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch \u0111\u00e1ng k\u1ec3. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, th\u1ea5u hi\u1ec3u s\u00e2u v\u1ec1 TikTok v\u00e0 bi\u1ebft c\u00e1ch t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 truy\u1ec1n th\u00f4ng, Lemon Digital ch\u1eafc ch\u1eafn s\u1ebd l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u00e1ng tin c\u1eady.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"IllhdmGJRo8Fc8xW7til2HR2gRd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZgVadBUjzo1nfUxOLYtleu14gSf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li><strong><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong><\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRPMdIWAIolFHnxncbclDgr7gbh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KUCrd0FfAoJ16Px0DUvlTKLzgFb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TJ29d80sjosJH6xQsBTlURhLgef\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Website: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PURedjIAzoOTfPxe0lnlYfROgNc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\/?locale=vi_VN\">https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\/?locale=vi_VN<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KZfedMxhroSP8rxQeE4l38bhgZg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HxmjdmILzoyB7BxZl0lldwIFgqg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>TikTok Agency kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p trong su\u1ed1t h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok. Nh\u1eefng ti\u00eau ch\u00ed l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn n\u00e0o l\u00e0 uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng TikTok Agency l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng ai. H\u00e3y c\u00f9ng kh\u00e1m [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":